Our client, Pink Valley Wines & Restaurant is keen to recruit an exceptional Head Chef for their renowned restaurant, situated on one of Stellenbosch's most picturesque wine estates.
This opportunity is ideal for a passionate culinary professional who combines exceptional cooking ability with strong leadership skills. Our client is seeking a hands-on Head Chef who can inspire and develop a high-performing kitchen team while consistently delivering outstanding culinary experiences that reflect the quality and reputation of the Pink Valley brand.
Reporting to the COO, the successful candidate will take full responsibility for leading the kitchen operation, ensuring operational excellence, financial discipline and exceptional food quality. A key focus of the role is building and managing a motivated, engaged and high-performing kitchen team that consistently exceeds guest expectations.
