Essential qualifications, skills, and experience:
• Proven experience as a Head Chef or experienced Chef within a high-quality restaurant, hospitality or wine estate environment;
• Demonstrated experience leading, coaching and developing kitchen teams;
• Strong knowledge of food costing, stock management, purchasing and kitchen financial controls;
• Sound understanding of food safety, hygiene and health legislation;
• Excellent planning, organisational and communication skills;
